OL,3,GNEWSADemolition road works to last 'few
OL,4,Amore weeks'
OL,5,
OL,6,FDrivers using one of Nottingham busiest
OL,7,Froads are being asked for continued
OL,8,Fpatience with work to remove a city
OL,9,Flandmark continues.
OL,11,FMaid Marian Way, normally a dual
OL,12,Fcarriageway, has become a single lane
OL,13,Fcontraflow due to the demolition of the
OL,14,Fcar park which straddles the route.
OL,16,FThe works began on 28 September and
OL,17,Fhave caused long queues on roads as
OL,18,Fwell as delays for bus and tram
OL,19,Fservices.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
