OL,3,GNEWSADemolition road works to last 'few
OL,4,Amore weeks'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe project, which includes the
OL,7,Fclearance of former Nottingham College
OL,8,Fbuildings on the other side of the
OL,9,Froad, is due to finish at the end of
OL,10,FNovember and council leader Nagat Khan
OL,11,Fsaid: "I am grateful to everyone for
OL,12,Ftheir patience".
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
